  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86c557fa066738eba849fb55c4db9f2fc1e4369e.png\" alt=\"新鲜食物\"></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YqKBQtWE9T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1371956415479939173?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=728ADA\" alt=\"Discord服务器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@swip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCgbhEot28IcFLwTiArTJXeg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Youtube&amp;color=FF0034\" alt=\"YouTube频道订阅人数\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1238490?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=curseforge&amp;color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/UoLAbzII?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;color=1CD96A\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/iamcyberia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/followers/iamcyberia?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;label=Github\" alt=\"GitHub关注者\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/899c0e364c509449cd21d46c78cd5a7775ff9951.png\" alt=\"描述\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">这款资源包将游戏中的每种食物都从零开始转化为自定义3D模型，为它们增添了急需的视觉魅力。默认情况下，GUI、物品展示框和地面模型将保持2D，使其与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fanimated-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animated Textures</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdetail-brush\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Detail Brush</a> 等更改精灵图的资源包兼容。但若你更想使用这些部分的3D版本，借助 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RespackOpts</a> 即可实现！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此外，每种食物还有独特的食用动画！苹果从四周被啃食，鱼下方有鱼骨，还有更多等你发现。（……或者说品尝）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在最新的更新中，所有食物类型还新增了可命名的变体，这样你就可以将它们放在物品展示框中，让食物看起来像真的摆在桌上一样。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如何获得食物的盘装变体？</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/iamcyberia/fresh-food/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a97c15f503729d779fc6f2f2a9eeec71ff7d2dd4_0.webp\" alt=\"物品列表\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7O6CWgewc3I\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fhq2897wdafu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab8a431924048c60b1386c9524ffab14d7be9c12.jpeg\" alt=\"emberhost\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此资源包由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fember.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ember Host</a> 赞助。点击上方图片或使用代码 <strong>\"CYBER\"</strong>，首次购买可享受10%折扣！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">选择 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fember.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ember Host</a> 托管你的Minecraft服务器，利用其强大的AMD处理器，以卓越价格获得超值体验！</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6570fc1c8af37836ab6d9863e9b10a47862ff43.png\" alt=\"重要提示\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>推荐模组：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7973e4bec682af65b679ea7723d4efc40fd756a5_0.webp\" alt=\"Hold My Items\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/03d2e11e5df263c6fefdbdb4516e853dfcc71500_0.webp\" alt=\"RespackOpts\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnot-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe83d7884470e5dc62c0f493c7c55d571512d0fb_0.webp\" alt=\"Not Enough Animations\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstewdrinksound\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b2c473d1eadf4df79b39c6a0bf42c5547936fdd8_0.webp\" alt=\"StewDrinkSounds\" width=\"30%\">&nbsp;</a></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.5及以下版本必需模组</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7b4cce0eaf26b087b4f5558da97693137287ae07_0.webp\" alt=\"Modefite\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpuzzle\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe555dd0bdf65703c4aed38e303192757bea028d_0.webp\" alt=\"Puzzle\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/14796f43c681efd5376322b5e79903c3cde93de7_0.webp\" alt=\"Sinytra Connector\" width=\"30%\"></a></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-x-fresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ad08d536afb70ea04c5c670734f0dcc25426dd9b.png\" alt=\"Fresh Food x Bare Bones\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8b6e383aea47901c3b3b0bc3cc4aed78bebacf7.png\" alt=\"即将推出的功能\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">更多可命名变体。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">部分模型的重制纹理。</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af5cdff06b99e6c7ba21ae04072e98688dd2674b.png\" alt=\"额外内容\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">特别感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbraysworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Braytonks</a>，他不仅擅长制作物品，还擅长讲解制作方法！特别感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fHellay)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellay</a> 为部分物品制作了精灵图和纹理。特别感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fweskerson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weskerson</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ftixork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dani</a> 提供的核心着色器！还有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcubert1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cubert</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpatovskiz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pato</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fHellay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellay</a> 作为我的朋友们 :)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">最后但同样重要的是，我要感谢我Discord中的所有测试者，他们通过反馈和寻找bug给予了我巨大帮助！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所有测试者：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fQuackingQuark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">QuackingQuark</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcapybaranamed2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capybaranamed2</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fICE_MASTER\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ICE MASTER</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcommunist_lemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">communist_lemon</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAchtari\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Achtari</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmidvightmirage_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">midvightmirage_</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252frjwaslive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">rjwaslive</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPhillWer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PhillWer</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsudl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sudl</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fdevicestation4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hours.wav</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">RB</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Duckman</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252falballam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yousef</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPrinceInah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prince Inah</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
